: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">신청기간 종료 후 2주</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 소요)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 기타사항 : 수강취소신청 전 본인 원스톱 반납계좌 등록 및 확인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt; 원스톱에 등록된 반납계좌로 반환됨 &gt;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
